# Defensive Duelist

**Prerequisite**: Dexterity 13 or higher

When you wield a finesse weapon with which you are proficient, you gain the following benefits:

---

- When another creature hits you with a melee attack, you may use your reaction to add your tier bonus to your AC against that attack, potentially causing it to miss.

- While wielding a finesse weapon in one hand and no other weapons, you gain a +1 bonus to AC.

- You may use this feature a number of times equal to your tier bonus. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.
